<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:TPM="http://texlive.dante.de/"><rdf:Description about="http://www.miktex.org/packages/figureversions"><TPM:Name>figureversions</TPM:Name><TPM:Creator>mpc</TPM:Creator><TPM:Title>Figure versions for LaTeX</TPM:Title><TPM:Version>1.0.1</TPM:Version><TPM:TargetSystem minVersion=""></TPM:TargetSystem><TPM:Description>The figureversions package defines several commands to switch between figure versions, which determine the appearance of numbers in your document. The package works with many font packages available on CTAN as well as with most OpenType fonts under XeTeX and LuaTeX in combination with fontspec.</TPM:Description><TPM:RunFiles size="18666">texmf\tex\latex\figureversions\figureversions.sty</TPM:RunFiles><TPM:TimePackaged>1746359896</TPM:TimePackaged><TPM:MD5>71ad495b0ca6ce9079f73763f40516c5</TPM:MD5><TPM:CTAN path="/macros/latex/contrib/figureversions"/><TPM:Copyright owner="Michael Ummels" year="2025"/><TPM:License type="lppl1.3c"/></rdf:Description></rdf:RDF>